codex
The MTE branch compares a depth in bits—8, 16, 32, or 64—with 4, so it never selects RGBA. For the buffer defect, counting `MEM_WRITE` calls cannot distinguish the repair: initialization changes neither the call count nor its length. The oracle needs to observe initialization state; value checks alone cannot prove it.
